     5544             then n-pay-date = n-doc-date .
     5545             else n-pay-date = min-date + (if buf_contract.srok-opl <> ? then buf_contract.srok-opl else 0 ) .
     5546     run fin-ob-code in this-procedure ( input g#db-num, output p-doc-code) .
     5547     run create-fin-liab in this-procedure (
